WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.650
Eight people work in a small office.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:07.030
Here are their monthly salaries,
one dot each on a number line.

3
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.730
Good news: the boss gives everyone
a pay rise of one hundred pounds.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.040
Every dot is about to move.

5
00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.240
Pause here, before they do.

6
00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.570
The average salary will change.

7
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.100
But what happens to
the standard deviation?

8
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:22.670
Up by a hundred pounds?

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.420
Down?

10
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.590
Or the same?

11
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.530
In this mission, you'll find the mean: add
the values and divide by how many there

12
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.250
are.

13
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.670
Then you'll measure
spread, with the range,

14
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.620
the IQR and the standard deviation,
which you'll find on your GDC.

15
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:42.450
Your mission: decide what happens to the
standard deviation after the pay rise.
